I asked whether it is possible to program the built-in graphics on a 
3000/300LX  to use a lower resolution than 1280x1024.

The answer is NO.  1280x1024 is wired in.  The ZLX boards CAN run at variable 
resolutions, but even this is via switches read at power up rather than truly 
programmable.

